# 8. 🧠 Learning Architecture

GenIQ uses a structured educational model such as:

```text
Subject
   ↓
Chapter
   ↓
Sub-topic
   ↓
Concept
   ↓
Formula
   ↓
Example
   ↓
Practice / PYQ
   ↓
Revision
```

The underlying general educational concepts are not claimed as exclusive inventions.

However, the **original implementation, organization, data structure, UI representation, content mapping, code and creative presentation** used by GenIQ may be proprietary.

You may not copy the GenIQ implementation and present it as an independent project.

---

